# Again drawer UI — square shape only

In Again drawers (partner/customer, customer groups, sales nested drawers, etc.) **nothing is rounded**. Buttons, list boxes, pills, close icons, resize grips, and cards use sharp square corners (`rounded-none`).

## Forbidden

- `rounded-sm`, `rounded`, `rounded-md`, `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`, `rounded-full`, pills

## Action buttons

In the control bar use `AgainDrawerButton` (`primary` / `action` / `success` / `danger`), `AgainDrawerSwitch` and `AgainDrawerCloseButton` from the same file - see `docs/common/drawercommon.md`, "Button types". The constants below are for places the component cannot be used.

Use shared constants from `apps/web/src/components/again/again-drawer.tsx`:

- `AGAIN_DRAWER_PRIMARY_BTN` — Save / Confirm (purple via `AGAIN_DRAWER_PRIMARY_COLOR`)
- `AGAIN_DRAWER_ACTION_BTN` — Discard / Cancel / secondary

Both already use `rounded-none`.

## Lists & panels

Group lists, status chips, and bordered containers inside these drawers must use `rounded-none` (not `rounded-sm`).

## Close / icon buttons

Override the default UI `Button` radius:

```tsx
<Button variant="ghost" size="icon" className="h-8 w-8 rounded-none" />
```

## Do not

- Soft radii on Save/Discard or any drawer chrome
- Rounded group list wrappers or drag rows
- Pill-shaped status badges in Again drawers
